-  // a "ToUnicode" mapping file is used to convert from CIDs (which
-  // begins at decimal 0) to Unicode code. (See ToUnicode Mapping File
-  // Tutorial - Adobe
-  // https://www.adobe.com/content/dam/acom/en/devnet/acrobat/pdfs/5411.ToUnicode.pdf
